Package: zuregex
Title: Bundled 'PCRE2' Regular Expressions with a C Interface
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Philip", "Hazel", role = "cph",
